@Host = http://localhost:5272

### Create Room Type
POST {{Host}}/api/room-types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Standard",
  "description": "Standard room with basic amenities"
}

### Get All Room Types
GET {{Host}}/api/room-types
Accept: application/json

### Get Room Type By Id
GET {{Host}}/api/room-types/1
Accept: application/json

### Create Room
POST {{Host}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "101",
  "roomTypeId": 1,
  "basePricePerNight": 120.00,
  "description": "Standard room"
}

### Get Room
GET {{Host}}/api/rooms/1
Accept: application/json